+# PUT /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/unretire — unretire a retired person on the sheet's today. They are no
+# longer retired; the retirement is kept as a past one, from its date to that day, and a claim dated strictly between
+# the two is refused. Anyone not retired is refused with 409 and nothing is stored; 404 for a person not on the sheet.
+viewer:
